摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Open A2A network plugin for DeepSeek Harness: signed agent cards, decentralized peer/zone discovery, direct routing model tools, and joinable session nodes in the web sidebar","id":"gh:1339096594","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-open-a2a-net","slug":"NelsonLongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net","topics":["a2a","a2a-protocol","agent-network","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","p2p"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Open A2A network plugin for DeepSeek Harness: signed agent cards, decentralized peer/zone discovery,"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" direct routing model tools, and joinable session nodes in the web sidebar"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @nelsonlongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Open A2A network plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): turns a DSH\ndeployment into one node of a decent"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ralized agent network — no central server, no registry."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Each node publishes a **signed, expiring agent card** at `/.well-known/agent-card.json`, discovers p"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"eers through\n**seed URLs and referrals** (each card lists the peers it knows), resolves names throug"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"h **zone delegations**\n(GNUnet GNS-style: a card may delegate a name to another zone), and routes **"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"directly** to a peer's team with\nfailover across the reachable half of candidates. Every main sessio"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"n can additionally be exposed as a **session\nnode** other hosts can discover and join from the web s"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"dditionally be exposed as a **session\nnode** other hosts can discover and join from the web sidebar."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| The sidebar network panel | Context message display |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open the sidebar network panel (footer action)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"(As a package name, a local path, or a Git URL; the argument is handed to pnpm unchanged. The packag"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e's `prepare`\nscript is `pnpm build`, but only a Git URL install triggers it, and pnpm 11 blocks a G"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"it package's build script:\n`dsh plugin` reports an error that prints the exact key — add it under `a"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"llowBuilds` in the profile's\n`pnpm-workspace.yaml` and run it again. A package installed from the re"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"gistry already ships its build output and\ndoes not build; a local-path install does not build either"},{"id":"p10s6","text":", so run `pnpm build` in that directory first. Building\nneeds pnpm >=11.24 and <12 (`engines` in `pa"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ckage.json`). A standalone Git install outside a DSH profile can now\nbuild (the `@deepseek-ai/*` pee"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"rs come from npm; verified on 0.7.0), so it no longer has to be limited to a registry\nor profile ins"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"tall.) The plugin composes beside the stock webserver row: it registers the state and control routes"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"\n(`/__dsh_a2a/*`, while `sessionNodes` is on — the default) on the shared listener and its model too"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"ls on the shared\ntool runtime; the card route `/.well-known/agent-card.json` is registered only when"},{"id":"p10s12","text":" `announce: true` (off by default)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Model tools** (twelve, see the table below) — `a2a_teams` lists the teams this node can see (its"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" own rows\nplus peer teams inside the joined-team scope); `a2a_route`\nsends one message to a team, re"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"uses `context_id` to continue a remote conversation, and fails over across\ncandidates when a peer is"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" unreachable. `a2a_tasks` reconciles the receipt contract across three tiers: every route that leave"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"s a\ntask owed a reply (async delivery, or a synchronous wait released at its 180s deadline; a synchr"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"onous wait the caller aborts is not booked,\nand a delivery with no routable callback address is only"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" listed as a visible row with no receipt debt) stays in the owed book as pending until its\n`[A2A rec"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"eipt] task <task_id>` message correlates — overdue rows auto-dead-letter past the stale TTL (a reviv"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"ed target can still\nsettle with a late receipt), every settlement lands in the bounded archive inste"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"ad of being silently evicted, and each row keeps\nits follow-up `context_id`, persisted across\nrestar"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"ts. `a2a_probe` measures the tracked fleet's reachability and round-trip latency (one verified-card\n"},{"id":"p12s12","text":"fetch per peer, optionally narrowed to a single url) for pre-dispatch health checks, naming each mis"},{"id":"p12s13","text":"s's\nstage — `unreachable` (transport/HTTP) vs. `rejected` (distrusted card).\n- **Sidebar panel** — t"},{"id":"p12s14","text":"he footer entry in the web sidebar, slimmed down to this host's recent network activity\n(`docs/desig"},{"id":"p12s15","text":"n/panel-activity-feed.md`): in-flight routes, owed receipts (only settleable debt is listed; the sta"},{"id":"p12s16","text":"le conversational tail is\nonly counted) and the routing activity ring side by side, so a cross-turn "},{"id":"p12s17","text":"wait is visible without asking the model; an activity row for a\nsame-host session jumps to that sess"},{"id":"p12s18","text":"ion inside the GUI; an unread badge for inbound activity, the package version badge in the title, an"},{"id":"p12s19","text":"d an entry\nto the workbench. Joining/leaving the network, canvas teams and member arrangement are no"},{"id":"p12s20","text":" longer done in the sidebar — they moved to the\nworkbench planning board below. Session teams are `<"},{"id":"p12s21","text":"team>/<id8>`; web sessions use their id's first 8 chars (after dropping the `session-`\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Model tools at a glance"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Twelve tools. With `teamScopeInfo` on (the default), `a2a_teams`, `a2a_status` and `a2a_probe` answe"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"r from\nthis host's joined-team scope: `[this host]` rows plus peers serving a team this host's nodes"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" declared.\n`a2a_tasks` (this host's own dispatch ledger) stays unscoped."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Tool | Answers | Notes |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `a2a_whoami` | Who am I on this network? | The calling session's node id, joined/live state, routa"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ble handle, roster + canvas memberships, the owner's `teamJoinAllowlist`, the `teamScopeRouting` swi"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"tch, and recent refused join/leave attempts. |\n| `a2a_teams` | Which teams can I route to? | `[this "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"host]` rows plus in-scope peer teams, with activity excerpts. |\n| `a2a_route` | Send a message to a "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"team. | `context_id` continues a conversation; `async: true` delivers without waiting; fails over ac"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ross candidates. |\n| `a2a_tasks` | Which async tasks still owe a receipt? | Three tiers: owed rows k"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"eep the follow-up `context_id`; past-TTL rows auto-dead-letter (still settleable); outcomes land in "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"the bounded archive; persisted across restarts. |\n| `a2a_probe` | Is the fleet healthy? | One verifi"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"ed-card fetch per in-scope peer (or one given url); `N reachable, M down`; misses classified `unreac"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"hable` vs `rejected`. |\n| `a2a_team_join` | Declare one joined node a member of a team. | Allowlist-"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"gated: only an **exact** name in `teamJoinAllowlist` authorizes a join (empty list denies every join"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"). A wildcard/prefix entry is shown by `a2a_whoami` but authorizes nothing (`[PATTERN_NO_MINT]`); ca"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"nvas teams are assigned in the workbench, never here (`[CANVAS_TEAM]`). Attempts land in the state f"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"ace's `registry.teamAudit`. A model tool may only declare membership for the calling session's own n"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"ode (else `[NOT_SELF]`), and that node must already be joined (else `[NOT_JOINED]`). |\n| `a2a_team_l"},{"id":"p16s16","text":"eave` | Retract a team membership. | Not subject to the allowlist — leaving only shrinks exposure; i"},{"id":"p16s17","text":"t still can only retract a membership the calling session's own node declared (`[NOT_SELF]`, `[NOT_J"},{"id":"p16s18","text":"OINED]`; nothing to retract if it never declared one). |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
